{"voice":"kokoro/af_heart","clips":[{"i":0,"text":"Hi, I’m Sahnawaz — a full-stack developer and UI designer from Assam. Everything on this site is hand-coded, with no templates. Let me show you around in under three minutes.","file":"step-1-a22600d6.mp3","seconds":12.62,"bytes":101229,"words":[[0.525,0.825],[0.9,1.113],[1.113,1.925],[1.113,1.925],[2.0,2.125],[2.125,2.7],[2.7,3.312],[3.312,3.487],[3.487,3.95],[3.95,4.45],[4.45,4.6],[4.6,5.475],[5.638,6.15],[6.15,6.325],[6.325,6.513],[6.513,6.838],[6.838,7.0],[7.0,7.875],[7.975,8.162],[8.162,8.375],[8.375,9.325],[9.463,9.613],[9.613,9.775],[9.775,10.025],[10.025,10.175],[10.175,10.613],[10.613,10.688],[10.688,10.938],[10.938,11.175],[11.175,11.85]],"env":"","fps":25},{"i":1,"text":"These are the products I’ve built and shipped. This very website, StudyLens AI, a homework helper for students, and YojanaSahay, a free government-scheme finder used across India.","file":"step-2-21c437be.mp3","seconds":12.84,"bytes":102957,"words":[[0.55,0.825],[0.825,0.912],[0.912,1.0],[1.0,1.462],[1.462,1.663],[1.663,1.975],[1.975,2.125],[2.125,2.925],[3.062,3.337],[3.337,3.688],[3.688,4.35],[4.463,5.138],[5.138,5.8],[5.938,6.05],[6.05,6.475],[6.475,6.825],[6.825,6.95],[6.95,7.525],[7.6,7.725],[7.725,8.825],[8.988,9.125],[9.125,9.438],[9.438,10.238],[10.238,10.688],[10.688,10.988],[10.988,11.35],[11.35,12.075]],"env":"","fps":25},{"i":2,"text":"These numbers aren’t screenshots. They’re fetched from each product right now, while you watch.","file":"step-3-3834c175.mp3","seconds":6.14,"bytes":49389,"words":[[0.525,0.75],[0.75,1.1],[1.1,1.3],[1.3,2.3],[2.4,2.587],[2.587,2.9],[2.9,3.075],[3.075,3.3],[3.3,3.725],[3.725,3.925],[3.925,4.3],[4.375,4.575],[4.575,4.725],[4.725,5.35]],"env":"0000000000000079995999999994899840407999966876610000000000000099720998143589958983603799899603898758877778830008999899889977403662000000000000000000000","fps":25},{"i":3,"text":"I started in customer support for Xiaomi and Flipkart, then moved into an IT and developer role at Rapido. Support taught me to find what’s really going wrong.","file":"step-4-a560c342.mp3","seconds":11.47,"bytes":92013,"words":[[0.5,0.625],[0.625,1.0],[1.0,1.15],[1.15,1.625],[1.625,2.075],[2.075,2.237],[2.237,2.925],[2.925,3.062],[3.062,3.9],[4.0,4.237],[4.237,4.562],[4.562,4.825],[4.825,4.963],[4.963,5.725],[5.725,5.862],[5.862,6.375],[6.375,6.675],[6.675,6.775],[6.775,7.8],[8.0,8.488],[8.488,8.738],[8.738,8.875],[8.875,9.0],[9.0,9.287],[9.287,9.5],[9.5,9.775],[9.775,10.075],[10.075,10.7]],"env":"000000000000009830398979899995579600899983083319886211886289899977999999978972169700478740200000000001999999999984399945999816798503559888850000089797999994389869998878835887143897765530000000000000000009643999600357995799548208889986950548999985988888778776332000000000000000000000000","fps":25},{"i":4,"text":"Here are the milestones I’m proudest of, from multi-agent AI and a live system health dashboard to my signature Hacker Mode. Every card opens the full story.","file":"step-5-0904affa.mp3","seconds":11.26,"bytes":90285,"words":[[0.525,0.762],[0.762,0.838],[0.838,0.925],[0.925,1.6],[1.6,1.8],[1.8,2.263],[2.263,2.65],[2.75,2.95],[2.95,3.663],[3.663,4.425],[4.425,4.562],[4.562,4.625],[4.625,4.95],[4.95,5.275],[5.275,5.562],[5.562,6.312],[6.312,6.412],[6.412,6.625],[6.625,7.15],[7.15,7.5],[7.5,8.225],[8.412,8.725],[8.725,9.075],[9.075,9.438],[9.438,9.525],[9.525,9.75],[9.75,10.5]],"env":"0000000000000029999998999999993008988898688885438998961077663100000000199999999336999995996068999988888870000000688889999983009701998689850009989776058877852003899994000967995789866885168898766544300000000000000099779916699999778980899708704987100876565532000000000000000000000000","fps":25},{"i":5,"text":"This is my everyday toolkit: React and JavaScript up front, Node and Firebase behind, and Figma for design. One person, from first sketch to production.","file":"step-6-56112c5d.mp3","seconds":11.33,"bytes":90861,"words":[[0.525,0.7],[0.7,0.85],[0.85,1.062],[1.062,1.